```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[main.py / app.py 启动] --> B[python-dotenv 加载 .env]
    B --> C[agent/config.py 执行 os.getenv]
    C --> D{主 Agent LLM}
    D --> D1[base_url = DEFAULT_LLM_BASE_URL]
    D --> D2[api_key = LLM_API_KEY]
    D --> D3[model = LLM_MODEL]
